  "description": "Steel Reserve 1.2 comes ready for the trails with a Marzocchi DJ3 suspension fork and 100MM of travel. The fork is mounted to a full crmo SR frame with internal head tube that is available in a short and a long. Upgraded 26\" KMAX Pro double wall rims are paired with Kenda K-Rad 2.3\" wide tires. Steel Reserve 1.2 comes with a 3 pc crmo crankset and a 25/12 gear ratio that's ideally suited for freestyle mtb riding. SR 1.2 comes standard with a Tektro Auriga Hydraulic rear disc brake.\nHaro full Crmo Steel Reserve frame w/ internal head tube\n21.8\" TT (Short) & 22.5\" TT (Long) sizes\nMarzocchi DJ3 100mm travel fork w/ post mount\nHaro Crmo 8 Spline 3-pc crankset, 25t sprocket\nHaro Steel 65mm riser bar w/ Haro Counterfeit grips\nHaro Padded Slim 1 pc seat/post, 25.4mm\nWeinmann KMAX Pro alloy DW 36h rims\nPivit alloy disc cassette w/ 12t Crmo cog\nTektro Auriga HD-M285 hydraulic rear disc brake\nWellgo platform alloy pedals with replaceable pins",
